 ## Subtopics
 
 ### [Training Loop with Adaptive Regularization & LR Decay](2408-training-loop-with-adaptive-regularization-lr-decay.md)
-Defines the standard iterative optimization protocol for NeRFs, combining ray-batched SGD with exponential LR decay and a two-phase loss schedule. It differs from [FreeNeRF](7471-pixelnerf.md) by using simpler auxiliary models for depth supervision rather than annealing positional encoding frequencies, and explicitly manages regularization weights that decay alongside the learning rate.
